eric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Times New Roman\";\">     \r\n</span><!--[endif]-->AoteaNZ.com Partner Program<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Links</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Times New Roman\";\">     \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Partners\r\nmay use graphic and text links on your website, on your blogs, in your\r\nnewsletter, on your social networks and in your emails. </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Times New Roman\";\">     \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">AoteaNZ.com\r\nmay also be advertised \"offline\" in classified ads, magazines, and\r\nnewspapers.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Times New Roman\";\">     \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">You\r\nmay use the graphics and text provided to you by us, or you may create your own\r\nas long as we approve them by email; first.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><o:p> </o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\